## Performance Targets

- **Scan Speed**: Complete /24 network (254 hosts, 3 ports) in <30 seconds
- **Memory**: <50MB for 1000 host scan
- **Concurrency**: Default 100 parallel connections, configurable up to 1000
- **Startup Time**: <100ms cold start
- **Binary Size**: <5MB (release build, stripped)

